Output frames/
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 760
Set Height 520
Set Padding 14
Set Framerate 60
Set TypingSpeed 1ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type "cd $PAINTED_RECORDING_REPO" Enter
Type "unset NO_COLOR" Enter
Type "clear; uv run demos/patterns/live.py --static -q" Enter
Show
Sleep 1.4s
Hide
Type "clear; uv run demos/patterns/live.py -q" Enter
Show
Sleep 2.5s
Hide
Type "clear; uv run demos/patterns/live.py -v" Enter
Show
Sleep 2.5s
Hide
Type "clear; uv run demos/patterns/live.py --static -vv" Enter
Show
Sleep 2.3s
